        "content": "## WF3 · AI Merchant Assistant\n\nWebhook: `/webhook/merchant-assistant` (Header Auth)\n\n1. Load `hari_data_terakhir` from `core.data_info`\n2. Agent `gpt-6-luna` + MCP Client → WF2\n3. Structured output + guardrail → answer or escalate (`ops.tickets`)\n4. Fallback if AI fails (no crash)\n\nTelegram chat ingress: see WF3b.",
